 "contentHtml": "<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lF2FlED.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"bbc_img\"></div><br><div class=\"quoteheader\"><div class=\"topslice_quote\">Quote</div></div><blockquote class=\"bbc_standard_quote\"><div align=\"center\">\"Yesterday, without warning, without grievance beyond their own manufactured envy, Athebyne struck our people in the dark. I will not stand before you and call this war - I will call it what it is: murder dressed in a flag. But I will tell you this, and I will mean every word: we will answer this butchery with everything Itoron has ever built, and we will answer it until no convoy, no worker, no citizen of this world need ever again look to the stars and wonder if today is the day they burn.\"</div><br><div style=\"text-align: right;\">— Director-General Samuel J. Harrows, address to the Combined Legislature, c176</div></blockquote><div class=\"quotefooter\"><div class=\"botslice_quote\"></div></div><br><hr><br><strong>// Overview:</strong><br>Draconis ships are built around flux capacity and speed over armor and shields. Doctrine revolves around rapid strikes with concentrated firepower followed by disengagement before combat readiness collapses. The ships excel in this role but struggle outside of it - catch one in a 1 vs Many engagement, and the thin protection quickly becomes a liability. Ballistics and missiles are the weapons of choice; the fleet is not built for prolonged flux wars so most energy weapons are tuned for high damage high flux.<br><br><strong>// History:</strong><br>The Draconis Defense Alliance is a stratocracy governing the Fafnir system - a state of emergency declared at the end of a brutal civil war and never rescinded. Fleet Admiral Emil August, who shattered the rebel world of Athebyne with seventy-two hours of orbital bombardment, has ruled by consolidated military authority ever since. The Alliance's independence is maintained through geographic isolation, a doctrine of total resistance, and arrangements with outside powers that neither party publicly acknowledges.<br><br><hr><br><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Levianeer/Draconis-Fleet/releases/latest/download/Draconis-Fleet.zip\" class=\"bbc_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AWsrXTX.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"bbc_img\"></a><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Levianeer/Draconis-Fleet/refs/heads/main/changelog.md\" class=\"bbc_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GGmSlFR.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"bbc_img\"></a><br><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1nfJO9uCa-JLtIFpPJN8pvpXLOiktUfuj/edit?usp=sharing&amp;ouid=100346657180264410538&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true\" class=\"bbc_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/k8O8dJ5.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"bbc_img\"></a></div><br><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\" class=\"bbc_size\"><span class=\"bbc_u\"><strong><span style=\"color: red;\" class=\"bbc_color\">Requires</span> <a href=\"https://fractalsoftworks.com/forum/index.php?topic=5444\" class=\"bbc_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">LazyLib</a>, <a href=\"https://fractalsoftworks.com/forum/index.php?topic=10982\" class=\"bbc_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GraphicsLib</a><span style=\"color: red;\" class=\"bbc_color\"> and</span> <a href=\"https://fractalsoftworks.com/forum/index.php?topic=25868\" class=\"bbc_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">MagicLib</a></strong></span></span></div><br><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\" class=\"bbc_size\"><strong>Supports: <a href=\"https://fractalsoftworks.com/forum/index.php?topic=9175\" class=\"bbc_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Nexerelin</a>, <a href=\"https://fractalsoftworks.com/forum/index.php?topic=10399\" class=\"bbc_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Combat Chatter</a>, <a href=\"https://fractalsoftworks.com/forum/index.php?topic=21280\" class=\"bbc_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AdvancedGunneryControl</a> and <a href=\"https://fractalsoftworks.com/forum/index.php?topic=16677\" class=\"bbc_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Commissioned Crews</a></strong></span></div><br><hr><br><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\" class=\"bbc_size\"><strong>Known Issues:</strong></span><ul class=\"bbc_list\"><li>The Colony Crisis can be triggered with zero AI cores installed.</li></ul><br><hr><br><strong>// Ships:</strong><br><div align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6fKqspt.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"720\" class=\"bbc_img resized\"></div><br><hr><br><strong>// Credits:</strong><br><span class=\"bbc_u\">Ed Harrison — Music from NEOTOKYO° OST, used with permission.</span><br><em>Support him here! <a href=\"https://x.com/00edit/\" class=\"bbc_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://x.com/00edit/</a>, <a href=\"https://edharrison.net/\" class=\"bbc_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://edharrison.net/</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://edharrison.bandcamp.com/\" class=\"bbc_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://edharrison.bandcamp.com/</a></em><br><br><span class=\"bbc_u\">Solis — Portrait Artwork &amp; Support.</span><br><em>Support him here! <a href=\"https://x.com/DrSolis_en\" class=\"bbc_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://x.com/DrSolis_en</a></em><br><br><span class=\"bbc_u\">Duckie0012 — Playtesting &amp; Support.</span><br><em>Support him here! <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Duckie0012\" class=\"bbc_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.youtube.com/@Duckie0012</a></em><br><br><span class=\"bbc_u\">NisaNisaNii — Playtesting &amp; Support.</span><br><br><span class=\"bbc_u\">Tartiflette — Various Scripts.</span><br><br><span class=\"bbc_u\">X4: Foundations — Weapon SFXs.</span><br><br><span class=\"bbc_u\">Halo — Weapon SFXs.</span><br><em>Halo © Microsoft Corporation. Draconis Fleet was created under Microsoft's \"Game Content Usage Rules\" using assets from Halo, and it is not endorsed by or affiliated with Microsoft.<br>Terms of Usage: <a href=\"https://www.xbox.com/en-US/developers/rules\" class=\"bbc_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.xbox.com/en-US/developers/rules</a></em>",
